316 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 193 0 R
/E (Karaoke can be considered a strong design opportunity because it shares characteristics with broader music performance contexts, where emotional, social, and cognitive challenges shape user experience. Research shows that music performance anxiety is a complex and multi-factorial phenomenon influenced by fear of negative evaluation, social pressure, and individual psychological traits \(Dobos et al., 2018\). These factors highlight that musical participation is not only a technical activity, but also a socially situated and emotionally demanding experience. In karaoke settings, these dynamics are amplified by public or semi-public environments, making it a valuable context for design innovation. This suggests that karaoke offers significant opportunities for interface design to better support emotional comfort, participation, and social interaction.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
